# Uptime Kuma safety

## Read-only default

List monitors, heartbeats, status pages, and notification channels are fine when
Uptime Kuma work is authorized. Do **not**:

- delete a monitor, status page, or notification channel
- pause/resume in bulk across unrelated monitors
- change notification credentials or wipe tags

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object(s).

Prefer pause over delete when silence is enough. Never paste API keys or
notification webhook secrets into chat.
